    "detailed_description": "In distant mythical times, countless skyislands floated in the sky, miracles held together by ancient magical and elemental powers.<br>And you will be the reborn prince of the Pumpkin people, building defenses and traps against enemies. Build our home, revive our economy, and restore our kingdom to its glory!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170560/extras/41bac7f58378a5df1379b1bd85d0c6db.avif?t=1755199764\" data-has-big width=800 height=262 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-a thousand Things Wait to Be Done-</h2>The whole royal city has been almost reduced to ruins by the torrent of history. Bulldoze those ruins and wastelands and turn them into people's houses and farmland!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170560/extras/23d82e092d05e0ee21f6de9522ce1e27.avif?t=1755199764\" data-has-big width=800 height=263 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-build Defense-</h2>An arrow tower? The lightning tower? The Sorcerer's tower? Trap? If it works, build it!<br>However, if we are to defeat these monsters, we may need &quot;a little financial support&quot;!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170560/extras/501652cd8797c3d96470875f4a5fca65.avif?t=1755199764\" data-has-big width=800 height=263 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-resist the Monster Enemy-</h2>The kingdom was once full of glory, but it faded in the wind and frost. But these ambitious enemies will not rest there, whether they are monster or air bandits, we must not let them near the heart of the island!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170560/extras/33b7aee2d215047a4da23b6de4a0487e.avif?t=1755199764\" data-has-big width=800 height=263 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Magic world-</h2>Do you remember the magic you used in your lifetime? Perhaps not much impression, but it doesn't matter, driving the kingdom of the skyisland adventure, find those lost things!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170560/extras/216ab52aba5c1542f59d3c2fb3945c3a.avif?t=1755199764\" data-has-big width=800 height=262 /></span><br>Oh, right! You have to accumulate magic to be able to use powerful spells, it is common knowledge in the world!",
