n><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Magic world-</h2>Do you remember the magic you used in your lifetime? Perhaps not much impression, but it doesn't matter, driving the kingdom of the skyisland adventure, find those lost things!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170560/extras/216ab52aba5c1542f59d3c2fb3945c3a.avif?t=1755199764\" data-has-big width=800 height=262 /></span><br>Oh, right! You have to accumulate magic to be able to use powerful spells, it is common knowledge in the world!",
